#ASSERT `s 2 clerk of the court` `a person who, by whatever name or title they are designated, from time to time performs the duties of a clerk of the court` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 clerk of the court` `a person who neither is a clerk of the court nor performs a clerk of the court's duties` EQUALS NOTHING

-- common-law partner: cohabiting in a conjugal relationship, for a period of at least one year (12 months is in; 11 is out).
#ASSERT `s 2 common-law partner` TRUE 12 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 common-law partner` TRUE 11 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2 common-law partner` TRUE 36 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 common-law partner` FALSE 36 EQUALS JUST FALSE

