-- criminal organization offence (a): sections 467.11, 467.111, 467.12, 467.13; or a serious offence committed for a criminal organization; (b) conspiracy etc.
--   columns: form of the charge | the offence charged | serious offence by s 467.1(1) | committed for a criminal organization
#ASSERT `s 2 criminal organization offence` `the offence itself` (`Provision of the Code` OF 467.11, "") NOTHING FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 criminal organization offence` `the offence itself` (`Provision of the Code` OF 467.111, "") NOTHING FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 criminal organization offence` `the offence itself` (`Provision of the Code` OF 467.12, "") NOTHING FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 criminal organization offence` `the offence itself` (`Provision of the Code` OF 467.13, "") NOTHING FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 criminal organization offence` `the offence itself` (`Provision of the Code` OF 380, "") (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 criminal organization offence` `the offence itself` (`Provision of the Code` OF 380, "") (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2 criminal organization offence` `the offence itself` (`Provision of the Code` OF 380, "") (JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2 criminal organization offence` `the offence itself` (`Provision of the Code` OF 380, "") NOTHING TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2 criminal organization offence` `a conspiracy to commit the offence` (`Provision of the Code` OF 467.11, "") NOTHING FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 criminal organization offence` `an attempt to commit the offence` (`Provision of the Code` OF 380, "") (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 criminal organization offence` `being an accessory after the fact in relation to the offence` (`Provision of the Code` OF 467.13, "") NOTHING FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 criminal organization offence` `counselling in relation to the offence` (`Provision of the Code` OF 380, "") (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2 criminal organization offence` `a form of participation that is none of those` (`Provision of the Code` OF 467.11, "") (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- day means the period between six o’clock in the forenoon and nine o’clock in the afternoon (360 and 1260 minutes after midnight): both sides of both end-points.
#ASSERT `s 2 day` 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2 day` 359 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2 day` 360 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2 day` 361 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 day` 720 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 day` 1259 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 day` 1260 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2 day` 1261 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2 day` 1439 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2 day` 1440 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2 day` (0 MINUS 1) EQUALS NOTHING

-- document of title to goods includes (each named kind is within; any other document is not covered).
#ASSERT `s 2 document of title to goods` `a bought and sold note` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 document of title to goods` `a bill of lading` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 document of title to goods` `a warrant for the delivery or transfer of goods or any other valuable thing` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 document of title to goods` `a certificate for the delivery or transfer of goods or any other valuable thing` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 document of title to goods` `an order for the delivery or transfer of goods or any other valuable thing` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 document of title to goods` `any other document used in the ordinary course of business as evidence of the possession or control of goods, authorizing or purporting to authorize, by endorsement or by delivery, the person in possession of the document to transfer or receive any goods thereby represented or therein mentioned or referred to` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 document of title to goods` `a document that is none of those` EQUALS NOTHING

-- document of title to lands includes.
#ASSERT `s 2 document of title to lands` `a writing that is or contains evidence of the title, or any part of the title, to real property or to any interest in real property` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 document of title to lands` `a notarial or registrar’s copy of such a writing` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 document of title to lands` `a duplicate instrument, memorial, certificate or document authorized or required by any law in force in any part of Canada with respect to registration of titles that relates to title to real property or to any interest in real property` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 document of title to lands` `a document that is none of those` EQUALS NOTHING

-- dwelling-house means a residence building, and includes (a) a connected building within the curtilage, (b) a mobile unit designed as a residence and being used as one.
#ASSERT `s 2 dwelling-house` `the whole or any part of a building or structure that is kept or occupied as a permanent or temporary residence` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 dwelling-house` `a building within the curtilage of a dwelling-house that is connected to it by a doorway or by a covered and enclosed passage-way` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 dwelling-house` `a unit that is designed to be mobile and to be used as a permanent or temporary residence and that is being used as such a residence` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 dwelling-house` `a unit that is designed to be mobile and to be used as a permanent or temporary residence and that is not being used as such a residence` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2 dwelling-house` `a place that is none of those` EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- environment means the components of the Earth and includes (a) to (d) (read as closed).
#ASSERT `s 2 environment` `a component of the Earth` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 environment` `air, land or water` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 environment` `a layer of the atmosphere` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 environment` `organic or inorganic matter, or a living organism` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 environment` `an interacting natural system that includes components referred to in paragraphs (a) to (c)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 environment` `a thing that is none of those` EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- every one, person and owner, and similar expressions, include Her Majesty and an organization.
#ASSERT `s 2 every one, person and owner` `every one` `Her Majesty` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 every one, person and owner` `person` `an organization` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 every one, person and owner` `owner` `Her Majesty` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 every one, person and owner` `an expression similar to every one, person or owner` `an organization` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 every one, person and owner` `every one` `an individual` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2 every one, person and owner` `every one` `a subject of another kind` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2 every one, person and owner` `an expression that is not similar to those` `Her Majesty` EQUALS NOTHING

-- explosive substance includes (a), (b), (c).
