#ASSERT `s 2 justice system participant` `a peace officer within the meaning of any of paragraphs (b), (c), (d), (e) and (g) of the definition peace officer` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 justice system participant` `a civilian employee of a police force` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 justice system participant` `a person employed in the administration of a court` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 justice system participant` `a public officer within the meaning of subsection 25.1(1) or a person acting at the direction of such an officer` EQUALS JUST TRUE
