#ASSERT `s 2 trustee` `a person who is declared by any Act to be a trustee` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 trustee` `a person who is, by the law of a province, a trustee` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 trustee` `a trustee on an express trust created by deed` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 trustee` `a trustee on an express trust created by will` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 trustee` `a trustee on an express trust created by instrument in writing` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 trustee` `a trustee on an express trust created by parol` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 trustee` `a person who is none of those` EQUALS NOTHING

-- undertaking means, unless a contrary intention appears, an undertaking in Form 10 given to a peace officer.
