#ASSERT `s 2 undertaking` FALSE (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 2 undertaking` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- unfit to stand trial: unable on account of mental disorder to conduct a defence or instruct counsel, and in particular (a), (b), (c).
