#ASSERT `s 2 valuable security` `a debenture, deed, bond, bill, note, warrant, order or other security for money or for payment of money` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 valuable security` `a document of title to lands or goods wherever situated` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 valuable security` `a stamp or writing that secures or evidences title to or an interest in a chattel personal, or that evidences delivery of a chattel personal` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 valuable security` `a release, receipt, discharge or other instrument evidencing payment of money` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2 valuable security` `an instrument that is none of those` EQUALS NOTHING

