#ASSERT `s 2.1 the term has the meaning it has in subsection 84(1)` `automatic firearm` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2.1 the term has the meaning it has in subsection 84(1)` `cartridge magazine` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2.1 the term has the meaning it has in subsection 84(1)` `cross-bow` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
